  "scientific_interpretation": [
    "The report establishes bounded exploratory search integrity and describes selected tracks. It establishes no qualified sky or SETI detection.",
    "All 18 originating ON means exceed the five other fixed means, and both half-window means are positive. The tracks were selected on the same ON data, so these properties have selection bias and do not provide blind or independent confirmation.",
    "Exact OFF means span -0.028830067658898274 to +0.023155554339041682; other ON means reach +0.047042078113232244. The report must preserve this response in other scans. No OFF map search or qualified veto was performed, and small exact-track OFF values do not exclude nearby OFF structure.",
    "The profile residual is the dimensionless width-mean raw power divided by the full 2097152-channel joined float32 row median, minus the fixed flank median. It has no calibrated flux unit and differs from the detector ranking statistic.",
    "Each 4096-carrier detector normalization core uses a 501-channel filter applied to the halo crop. The native join and core boundary is not a data gap or median-filter image edge. Crossings and edge proximity alone establish no instrumental or astronomical origin.",
    "The 120 saved top20 entries are six separate selections for each ON and pair. They form no global top120 list and count as no independent trials. The 64-channel linkage groups include mixed winning drifts and have no calibrated clustering significance.",
    "The previously known 2300.390625 MHz stationary line lies within prior native171. It is outside both narrow boundary reference windows. These outputs provide no evidence for extrapolating that line to adjacent native chunk centers.",
    "This is the same historical 2017 six-scan visit. Native170 and native172 were selected after prior native171 results were known. These results provide no new independent visit, blind confirmation, calibrated global null test, sensitivity, EIRP, or test of barycentric or nonlinear models."
  ],
  "recommendation": "Retain these 18 fixed tracks as unresolved exploratory descriptors. Preserve exact OFF and other ON context, selection bias, and normalization conventions in the final report. Promote no detection or absence claim. Meaningful confirmation would require an independent comparable visit and prospectively defined calibration and veto, beyond these outputs.",
